# Catalog content updates (AI_MD)

When the user asks to add, change, or remove AI tools, **edit data directly**. Do not rebuild generator code or rerun bulk scripts unless they explicitly ask.

## Source of truth

- **`web/catalog.json`** — the live catalog the site loads (`loadCatalog()` in `data.js`)
- **`web/data.js`** — only for `TOP_TIER_IDS` / evaluations; not the full tool list

## Default workflow (low cost)

1. Edit `web/catalog.json` (add/update/remove entries).
2. **Do not** run `build_catalog.ps1`, `build_catalog.py`, or `generate-tools-md.ps1` for routine updates.
3. **Do not** regenerate all `web/tools/*.md` — detail pages fall back to catalog fields in `tool.js` when MD is missing.
4. Preview locally only if the user asks.
5. Commit and push **only when the user asks** to publish.

## Entry schema

```json
{
  "id": "kebab-case-unique",
  "name": "Tool Name",
  "description": "一句話簡介",
  "category": "對話助手|程式開發|…",
  "tags": ["标签"],
  "keywords": ["search", "关键词"],
  "rating": 4.5,
  "pricing": "Freemium|免費|付費|試用",
  "url": "https://…",
  "bestFor": "最適合場景"
}
```

## Preserve stable IDs

Never rename these IDs (links/bookmarks): `chatgpt`, `claude`, `gemini`, `cursor`, `github-copilot`, `midjourney`, `dalle`, `canva-ai`, `runway`, `elevenlabs`, `suno`, `perplexity`, `notion-ai`, `deepl`, `grammarly`, `figma-ai`, `stable-diffusion`, `kimi`, `codeium`, `gamma`, `remove-bg`, `otter`, `jasper`, `pika`.

## Bulk rebuild (rare)

Run `web/scripts/build_catalog.ps1` + `generate-tools-md.ps1` **only** when the user wants a full reseed from `build_catalog.py` SEEDS — not for normal content tweaks.

## User triggers (examples)

- 「加 10 個新的影片 AI 工具」
- 「更新 ChatGPT 的简介」
- 「把 XXX 从目录移除并 push」
- 「参考 Futurepedia 补一批写作工具」

Interpret intent, apply minimal diff to `catalog.json`, then publish if requested.
